1) Reduced the sensitivity of automatic requests for airdrops to improve the overall smoothness of unit movement;
2) Increased bullet and grenade explosions will knock away residual debris on the ground;
3) Level optimization;
4) Other performance optimizations.

Dear Players.
In order to bring you a better gaming experience, we have carried out this update. The details of the update are as follows:
[olist]
 Increased guidance across the board;
 Modified quests, adjusted mainline and side quests;
 Add props hint text;
 Optimize controls;
 Add music and sound effect switches;
 Add the option to lower the game difficulty;
 Fixed various gameplay bugs that were previously collected.[/olist]

During the trial period, we collected extensive feedback and suggestions from players. Based on your comments and suggestions, we have prioritised the following changes:
[olist]
 Optimised the console so that the default terminal text is not displayed;
 Re-organised the order of missions to reduce users performing too many missions at the same time;
 Added movement instructions for moving carriers to the deck;
 Added mouse rotation at the edge of the screen view, while middle button rotation is retained;
 Dialogue panels remain until mission dialogue is complete, voice can close the button;
 Blood bar grows;
 Lens can be pulled further away, scene visibility is larger;
 UI panel control button click does not close the panel, changed to zoom in and out;
 Changed fonts for terminals, dialogue, etc;
 Plot hiding for pipe card cards in world; 
 Esc to main menu, game paused.
[/olist]
Here, I would like to sincerely thank all the players have been on the game content of positive feedback, each of your comments are our driving force to move forward, prompting the game to continue to improve and progress.
